ing the homolog rather than the sister chromatid, and can tolerate mismatches in heteroduplex DNA, unlike the higher-fidelity RAD51 (PubMed:15164066, PubMed:26976601)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}